{
  "SchemaName": "NWL_LineLevel",
  "_comment": "NorthWest ships line level twice in one workbook: a Webpm sheet and a Daq sheet from two different billing systems, carrying the same data under different headers. Name below is the Webpm header and Aliases carry the Daq equivalent. Every spelling in one column entry is treated as interchangeable and each row takes the value from whichever of them its own sheet filled in. To support a renamed column, add the new spelling to that column's Aliases - no code change is needed.",
